{"id":"2b8910885bfb6ce8","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-oracle-cone-avoidance.md","title":"任意非零度的上下锥回避","display":"thm-oracle-cone-avoidance — 任意非零度的上下锥回避","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-oracle-cone-avoidance","aliases":["20-thm-oracle-cone-avoidance"],"display":"thm-oracle-cone-avoidance — 任意非零度的上下锥回避","chapter":"6","section":"6.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 6.2.6","source_printed_pages":[136],"source_pdf_pages":[170],"depends_on":["[[20-lem-no-oracle-splitting]]","[[20-df-degle]]","[[20-thm-jump]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-oracle-cone-avoidance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-oracle-cone-avoidance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-oracle-cone-avoidance — 任意非零度的上下锥回避"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 6.2.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>136</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>170</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5366527ad0dc16ba\" href=\"?note=5366527ad0dc16ba\" title=\"20-lem-no-oracle-splitting\">20-lem-no-oracle-splitting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b&gt;\\mathbf0\">\\(\\mathbf b&gt;\\mathbf0\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5366527ad0dc16ba\" href=\"?note=5366527ad0dc16ba\" title=\"20-lem-no-oracle-splitting\">20-lem-no-oracle-splitting</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}cone\\text{-}avoidance}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\ [\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf b&#39;\\land\\mathbf a\\not\\le\\mathbf b\\land\\mathbf b\\not\\le\\mathbf a].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}cone\\text{-}avoidance}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\ [\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf b&#39;\\land\\mathbf a\\not\\le\\mathbf b\\land\\mathbf b\\not\\le\\mathbf a].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取非可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathbf b\">\\(B\\in\\mathbf b\\)</span>，以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B&#39;\">\\(B&#39;\\)</span> 构造增长前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_s\">\\(\\sigma_s\\)</span>。奇数步骤在新位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 判断 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^B(n)\">\\(\\Phi_e^B(n)\\)</span> 是否停止，有则写入不同的布尔值，无则随意补位，确保 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\ne\\Phi_e^B\">\\(A\\ne\\Phi_e^B\\)</span>。偶数步骤用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\\le_TB&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\le_TB&#39;\\)</span> 判断当前前缀上是否有第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 个泛函的分裂。若有，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B&#39;\">\\(B&#39;\\)</span> 还计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(x)\">\\(B(x)\\)</span>，故选择分裂中异于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(x)\">\\(B(x)\\)</span> 的输出并扩张到该停止见证；若无，依上游引理，任何全输出都可计算，因而不能等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>每步至少补一位，得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_TB&#39;\">\\(A\\le_TB&#39;\\)</span> 及两向不可约。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_TB&#39;\">\\(A\\equiv_TB&#39;\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\le_TB&#39;\\le_TA\">\\(B\\le_TB&#39;\\le_TA\\)</span>，矛盾；所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg_T(A)&lt;\\mathbf b&#39;\">\\(\\deg_T(A)&lt;\\mathbf b&#39;\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 6.2.6；印刷页 136；PDF 第 170 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-lem-no-oracle-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"5366527ad0dc16ba","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-no-oracle-splitting]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-degle]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2ea8548c98f572c3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-no-oracle-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"5366527ad0dc16ba","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-lem-no-oracle-splitting]]；see [[20-df-degle]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-lem-no-oracle-splitting]]；see [[20-df-degle]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2ea8548c98f572c3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-lem-no-oracle-splitting]]；see [[20-df-degle]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf b>\\mathbf0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}cone\\text{-}avoidance}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\ [\\mathbf a<\\mathbf b'\\land\\mathbf a\\not\\le\\mathbf b\\land\\mathbf b\\not\\le\\mathbf a].","display":true},{"tex":"B\\in\\mathbf b","display":false},{"tex":"B'","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_s","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_e^B(n)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\ne\\Phi_e^B","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing'\\le_TB'","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"B'","display":false},{"tex":"B(x)","display":false},{"tex":"B(x)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A\\le_TB'","display":false},{"tex":"A\\equiv_TB'","display":false},{"tex":"B\\le_TB'\\le_TA","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg_T(A)<\\mathbf b'","display":false}],"bytes":1718,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["5366527ad0dc16ba","e888141c21b61ce5","2ea8548c98f572c3"]}